Files: vendor/*
Copyright: The authors of each crate, named in vendor/<crate>/Cargo.toml and in
 the license files of the crate.
License: other
 Each crate is under the license expression in the field "license" of its
 Cargo.toml. Most crates are under MIT, Apache-2.0 or a choice of both; presage,
 libsignal-service and the libsignal crates are under AGPL-3.0-only; others are
 under BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, ISC, MPL-2.0, Unicode-3.0, Zlib, Unlicense,
 CC0-1.0 or CDLA-Permissive-2.0, mostly as one choice among several. Some
 crates carry C libraries with their own license files: libsqlite3-sys builds
 the bundled SQLCipher (BSD-3-Clause, Zetetic LLC), aws-lc-sys and ring build
 AWS-LC and BoringSSL derived code (ISC, Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-3-Clause).
 /usr/share/doc/flare-signal/vendor-licenses.gz lists every crate with version
 and license expression and contains the license texts the crates ship.

